# tvOS project rules

Before making changes, read `AGENTS.md`, `TVOS-PRODUCT-DESIGN-BASELINE.md`,
`TVOS-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`, `TVOS-INTERACTION-SPEC.md`, and
`TVOS-RELEASE-CHECKLIST.md` as relevant to the task.

Respect the existing architecture and product design baseline. Keep changes
minimal and purposeful. Design for Siri Remote focus navigation, page return,
and loading/empty/error states. Run available builds and tests and report the
actual commands and results. Never claim tests or device validation that were
not actually performed.
